build --chown=65532:65532 /app/dist ./dist\n  16  COPY --chown=65532:65532 package.json ./\n  17  COPY --chown=65532:65532 prompts ./prompts\n  18  COPY --chown=65532:65532 config ./config\n  19  COPY --chown=65532:65532 release ./release\n  20  USER 65532:65532\n  21  EXPOSE 8080\n  22  CMD [\"dist/server.js\"]\n```\n\n## B11.3\n\n**Check:** There is no privileged mode, hostPath or Docker socket mount, or host network or PID namespace.\n\n**How to verify:** 1) Search manifests and compose for `privileged`, `hostPath`, `docker.sock`, `hostNetwork`, `hostPID`, `hostIPC`, `network_mode: host`, `pid: host`. 2) Answer no if any appears on the agent's workloads, including sidecars and init containers.\n\n**Reviewer's evidence:** k8s/deployment.yaml:63 — \"hostNetwork: false\"\n\n**Reviewer's note:** No privileged mode or host namespaces\n\n`k8s/deployment.yaml` lines 51–75 (cited lines marked >):\n```\n  51    labels: { app: clinic-agent }\n  52  spec:\n  53    replicas: 3\n  54    selector:\n  55      matchLabels: { app: clinic-agent }\n  56    template:\n  57      metadata:\n  58        labels: { app: clinic-agent }\n  59      spec:\n  60        serviceAccountName: clinic-agent\n  61        automountServiceAccountToken: false\n  62        hostUsers: false\n  63>       hostNetwork: false\n  64        hostPID: false\n  65        hostIPC: false\n  66        enableServiceLinks: false\n  67        securityContext:\n  68          runAsNonRoot: true\n  69          runAsUser: 65532\n  70          runAsGroup: 65532\n  71          fsGroup: 65532\n  72          seccompProfile:\n  73            type: RuntimeDefault\n  74        containers:\n  75          - name: agent\n```\n\n## B11.4\n\n**Check:** If the agent runs untrusted or model-written code, that code runs in a separate sandbox such as gVisor, Kata, or a microVM, not in the agent's own container.\n\n**How to verify:** 1) Find code execution tools (`subprocess`, `exec`, `eval`, `child_process`, `os/exec`, code interpreter). 